This repository provides high-level, conceptual reference code for academic

reading, review, and citation. It is not open-source software and may not be

used as a basis for model training or commercial development.



No training data, model weights, or TMDb-derived metadata are included in this

repository. Any external data must be obtained independently and in compliance

with its original terms of use.



